      "hash64": "16E28A0749937E51",
      "text": "Äh... Na ja...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "D186967D9003DF43",
      "text": "Du wirkst ja sehr überzeugt... Woher kommt\\ndiese Gewissheit?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "0B90D85BB6942513",
      "text": "Siehst du? Du klingst auch nicht gerade\\nzuversichtlich.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "D1869B7D9003E7C2",
      "text": "Aber da ich schon mal hier bin, werde ich meine\\nArbeit auch erledigen.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "D1869C7D9003E975",
      "text": "Schließlich... bin ich ein Profi.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
